# ON_USE_DONE — he USES a real thing that takes a while (blows a goat horn, brushes, looks through a
# spyglass), and when he is DONE the wish happens. Vanilla does the using exactly as it
# always does — the horn sounds, the spyglass zooms — and WishShapeEvents runs act() as him when he
# lets go or the use runs out. A wish about him happens on him; one about something else happens
# where he is pointing (the AIM line).
import common

function give()
${GIVES}
    /tellraw @s {"text":"${GIVE_MESSAGE}","color":"${HEX}"}
end

function act()
    ${AIM}
end

${EFFECT_BLOCK}
